<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 146 0 R
/T (   Drawing upon both artistic practice and academic research, the lecture addresses the challenges and possibilities that emerge when adapting maqam-based melodic and expressive principles to the piano. Particular attention is given to the role of quarter tones in shaping melodic identity, ornamentation, improvisational vocabulary, and intercultural musical dialogue.)
/E (   Drawing upon both artistic practice and academic research, the lecture addresses the challenges and possibilities that emerge when adapting maqam-based melodic and expressive principles to the piano. Particular attention is given to the role of quarter tones in shaping melodic identity, ornamentation, improvisational vocabulary, and intercultural musical dialogue.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
