/E (   Dina Kitrossky is a versatile pianist and acclaimed composer. Her innovative work merges jazz and Middle Eastern maqams, performed on her quarter-tone-tuned piano. Her debut album WAVES \(December 2023\) received significant acclaim. Obsessions, the upcoming album by the Dina Kitrossky Trio: Bar Geva \(bass\), Yaniv Loven \(drums\), featuring Itamar Borochov \(trumpet\). The new album is dedicated to Dina's exploration of maqam, quarter tones, jazz improvisation, and microtonal approaches within a contemporary trio setting. Notable Collaborations: Andalusian Orchestra Ashdod, Enrico Macias, Elad Levy, Omer Avital, Amir Shahsar, Madhav Haridas, Yaron Peer, Yinon Muallem ,Yuvi Gerstein. )
