/T ( The current research will try to find out details about the microtonality of the vocal parts in the recordings of these expeditions. As the amount of the recorded material is large, a non-representative selection of a few samples from different pieces will be taken and analysed pitch-by-pitch distinguishing the size of some of the constitutive intervals, attempting to derive a microtonal scale that can represent the pitch-related essence of the analysed piece.)
