/Title (The rapid expansion of microtonal music during the twentieth and twenty-first centuries has generated an extraordinary diversity of tuning systems, compositional approaches, and experimental instruments. However, this development has also revealed a fundamental problem that remains unresolved: the absence of a universal and standardized system for the reading and writing of microintervals.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1649 0 R
/Next 1658 0 R
>>
endobj
