1687 0 obj
<<
/Title (The presentation  is based on the author's  ongoing research  concerning the incorporation of Arabic musical elements into jazz and on her experience as a performing artist working with a microtonal piano. Historical precedents for microtonality in Western music and keyboard instruments will be briefly discussed, providing context for contemporary developments.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1675 0 R
/Prev 1685 0 R
/Next 1688 0 R
>>
